   "story_text": "Share your information if you are looking for work. Please use this format:<p><pre><code>  Location:\n  Remote:\n  Willing to relocate:\n  Technologies:\n  Résumé&#x2F;CV:\n  Email:\n</code></pre>\nPlease only post if you are personally looking for work. Agencies, recruiters, job boards,\nand so on, are off topic here.<p>Readers: please only email these addresses to discuss work opportunities.<p>Searchers: try <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.wantstobehired.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.wantstobehired.com</a>.",
